      "content": "The noise you're hearing is the sound of your own exhaustion, and it's loud because you've been fighting so hard for so long. If the cycle feels endless, maybe the goal shouldn't be to fix the cycle, but to just make the *next* moment quiet. A small, deliberate break—even a few minutes of absolute silence—can be a way to prove to yourself that stopping is possible.",
      "source": "target",
