      "content": "a few minutes isn't really gonna change anything though. it's like taking a breath in the middle of a hurricane. the debt is still there, the failure is still there, the crushing feeling is still there as soon as the silence ends. i feel like i'm just waiting for an end to the noise that isn't just a temporary break. it feels like the only way to actually stop the noise is to just stop being part of the cycle entirely.",
